---
import DefaultLayout from "../components/layout/DefaultLayout.astro";
---

<DefaultLayout
  title="About — CROW SYSTEMS"
  description="We are a specialized engineering team focused on transforming complex technical challenges into practical, scalable, and reliable solutions for growing businesses."
  activeNav="About"
>
  <section
    class="pt-32 pb-24 px-6 md:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto"
    aria-labelledby="about-heading"
  >
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-8">
        <span
          class="text-accent font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs mb-2 block"
          >Who We Are</span
        >
        <h1
          id="about-heading"
          class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-on-surface tracking-tight mb-6"
        >
          We Transform Complex Technical Challenges<br />Into Practical
          Solutions
        </h1>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed font-body text-lg">
          We are a specialized engineering team focused on transforming complex
          technical challenges into practical, scalable, and reliable solutions
          for growing businesses. Our mission is to help companies reduce
          technical complexity, improve operational efficiency, accelerate
          development, and confidently bring new ideas to life.
        </p>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed font-body text-lg">
          We work closely with startups, micro businesses, and medium-sized
          companies that need experienced technical leadership without the
          overhead of building large internal engineering teams.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div
          class="relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 bg-surface-container-high"
        >
          <img
            alt="Crow Systems Team"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522071820081-009f0129c71c?w=800&q=80"
          />
          <div
            class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-surface to-transparent"
          >
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section
    class="pt-24 pb-24 px-6 md:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto"
    aria-labelledby="mission-heading"
  >
    <h2
      id="mission-heading"
      class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-on-surface text-center mb-12"
    >
      Mission, Vision &amp; Values
    </h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div
        class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-10 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 hover:border-primary/50 transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md"
      >
        <div
          class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-8 transition-transform hover:scale-110"
        >
          <svg
            width="28"
            height="28"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            strokeWidth="2"
            class="text-primary"
            ><path d="M9 11l3 3L22 4"></path><path
              d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h11"
            ></path></svg
          >
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-on-surface">
          Mission
        </h3>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed font-body text-sm">
          To help companies reduce technical complexity, improve operational
          efficiency, and accelerate development — bringing practical, scalable,
          and reliable engineering solutions to growing businesses without the
          overhead of large internal teams.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div
        class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-10 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 hover:border-primary/50 transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md"
      >
        <div
          class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-8 transition-transform hover:scale-110"
        >
          <svg
            width="28"
            height="28"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            strokeWidth="2"
            class="text-primary"
            ><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path
              d="M2 12s3-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3 7-10 7-10-7-10-7z"></path><circle
              cx="12"
              cy="12"
              r="3"></circle></svg
          >
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-on-surface">
          Vision
        </h3>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed font-body text-sm">
          Technology should empower businesses, not slow them down. We envision
          a world where companies of all sizes can access the engineering
          expertise needed to transform ideas into real-world solutions and grow
          with confidence.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div
        class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-10 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 hover:border-primary/50 transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md"
      >
        <div
          class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-8 transition-transform hover:scale-110"
        >
          <svg
            width="28"
            height="28"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            strokeWidth="2"
            class="text-primary"
            ><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg
          >
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-on-surface">
          Core Values
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-on-surface-variant text-sm font-body">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-accent rounded-full"></span> Reliable, maintainable
            technology decisions
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-accent rounded-full"></span> Clear communication
            and transparency
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-accent rounded-full"></span> Practical, outcome-focused
            solutions
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-accent rounded-full"></span> Long-term scalability
            and value
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section
    class="pt-24 pb-24 px-6 md:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto"
    aria-labelledby="expertise-heading"
  >
    <h2
      id="expertise-heading"
      class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-on-surface text-center mb-12"
    >
      Our Expertise
    </h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <div
        class="bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/30 rounded-xl p-8"
      >
        <h4 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">
          Networking &amp; Infrastructure Engineering
        </h4>
        <p
          class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm leading-relaxed font-body mb-4"
        >
          Specializing in secure communications, networking architecture,
          systems integration, and infrastructure design. Focused on ensuring
          systems can communicate efficiently, securely, and reliably in
          real-world environments.
        </p>
        <ul
          class="space-y-2 text-sm text-on-surface-variant font-body list-disc pl-5"
        >
          <li>Secure network design</li>
          <li>System connectivity and communications</li>
          <li>Hardware/software integration</li>
          <li>Distributed systems</li>
          <li>Reliable transport protocols</li>
          <li>Infrastructure optimization</li>
          <li>Cybersecurity-oriented architecture</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div
        class="bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/30 rounded-xl p-8"
      >
        <h4 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">
          Software &amp; Data Systems Engineering
        </h4>
        <p
          class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm leading-relaxed font-body mb-4"
        >
          Specializing in complex software systems, large-scale data processing,
          backend architecture, and business logic implementation. Focused on
          transforming complex operational requirements into maintainable and
          scalable software solutions.
        </p>
        <ul
          class="space-y-2 text-sm text-on-surface-variant font-body list-disc pl-5"
        >
          <li>High-performance backend systems</li>
          <li>Data processing pipelines</li>
          <li>Scalable application architecture</li>
          <li>API and platform development</li>
          <li>Complex business logic implementation</li>
          <li>Codebase optimization</li>
          <li>Developer experience improvements</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</DefaultLayout>
